1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,380
Slide 42 addresses "ENTERPRISE TENANT BOUNDARIES & PRIVACY: Compliance by Architecture."

2
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:17,138
Look at the left card: when employees paste proprietary company code into free consumer chatbots, that data gets stored in public training sets!

3
00:00:17,138 --> 00:00:22,060
That is a massive GDPR and SOC2 violation that can trigger million-dollar fines!

4
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:31,034
Look at the right card: with Spark OS in Google Cloud, your agent executes strictly inside your enterprise's private tenant.

5
00:00:31,034 --> 00:00:36,830
Zero customer data is ever used for model training under legally binding enterprise SLAs!

6
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:45,101
And all SQLite databases and vector memories are encrypted using Customer-Managed Encryption Keys (CMEK)!

7
00:00:45,101 --> 00:00:48,120
Even Google engineers cannot see your data!

8
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:57,080
Fully compliant with SOC2 Type II, ISO 27001, and HIPAA data residency requirements!

9
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:04,120
True enterprise readiness requires uncompromising privacy and legal compliance.

